"Sts. Francis Xavier, Peter Canisius, Robert Bellarmine, Aloysius Gonzaga, Isaac Jogues, Peter Claver": "San Francesco Saverio, san Pietro Canisio, san Roberto Bellarmino, san Luigi Gonzaga, sant’Isacco Jogues, san Pietro Claver",
