"Sts. Vincent de Paul, Louise de Marillac, Catherine Labouré, Justin de Jacobis": "San Vincenzo de’ Paoli, santa Luisa de Marillac, santa Caterina Labouré, san Giustino de Jacobis",
"Sts. Paul of the Cross, Gabriel of Our Lady of Sorrows, Gemma Galgani (associated), Charles of Mount Argus": "San Paolo della Croce, san Gabriele dell’Addolorata, santa Gemma Galgani (legata all’ordine), san Carlo di Mount Argus",
"Sts. Alphonsus Liguori, Gerard Majella, John Neumann, Clement Mary Hofbauer; Bls. Zenon Kovalyk, Mykola Charnetskyi": "Sant’Alfonso Maria de’ Liguori, san Gerardo Majella, san Giovanni Neumann, san Clemente Maria Hofbauer; beati Zenone Kovalyk, Mykola Čarnec’kyj",
